From abd55df3485d6308714c0c72150602aebcc3b050 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:31:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): name retained enum keys in parameter patch refusals

Keep merge-patch semantics and add field paths and merged keys to the
single-key map refusal. Document explicit null removal for shape changes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2876
